        "Id1": {
            "text": "Produced by the Espionage production team and now available in digital format, Mermaid is a reggae inspired song on Train's \"California 37\" album. Train followed up Mermaid with the John Lennon song Imagine."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The reggae song Mermaid is included in the album California 37 by Train. The song was produced by Espionage and is distributed digitally. Train followed Mermaid with their cover of the John Lennon song Imagine."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "Followed by the release of Imagine by John Lennon, the song Mermaid on Train's California 37 album is a digitally distributed reggae song produced by the product team Espionage."
        }
